config BR2_PACKAGE_PLEXOS_GPU
	bool "plexos-gpu"
	depends on BR2_x86_64
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBVA_UTILS
	help
	  Hardware transcoding diagnosis: enumerates DRM render nodes,
	  identifies the GPU, checks that the right VA-API driver and the
	  GuC/HuC firmware actually loaded, and says what to do when they
	  did not.

	  This is the tool the project exists for. The failure it addresses
	  is Plex falling back to software transcoding with nothing in any
	  log explaining why (ARCHITECTURE.md section 6).

	  It shells out to vainfo, which is why libva-utils is selected here
	  rather than merely assumed to be in the image.
